---
title: Articles
description: Articles about learning music and guitar as a blind person.
permalink: /articles/
---
{%- if collections.articles.length %}
<ul class="article-list">
{%- for article in collections.articles %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a>
    <time datetime="{{ article.date | isoDate }}">{{ article.date | readableDate }}</time>
    {%- if article.data.description %}
    <p>{{ article.data.description }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<p>No articles yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
